3.
[ Representation of Universities on the Board.
[Substituted by Notification No. 1/B 9-16/76 E-89, dated 5.5.1976.]
- Under the proviso to clause (c) of sub-section (1) of Section 4 of the Act, following shall be the order of rotation of the
Universities to be represented on the Board :
(a)
Patna University;
(b)
Magadh University;
(c)
Bihar University;
(d)
Lalit Narayan Mithila University;
(e)
Ranchi University;
(f)
Bhagalpur University;
(g)
Kameshwar Singh Sanskrit University.]
